    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microvania is a tiny metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So tiny, that the screen resolution is only 160x90!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depths of planet Micronus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse and backtrack through meticulously crafted pixels of caves, jungles, labs, ruins, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and make use of classic upgrade tropes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles, Claw, Ball-Mode and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise your play style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Microcards to modify your weapons and abilities.  Create your own play style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microvania respects your time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry about saving your progress - the game will create a checkpoint every time you enter a room, and you will spawn back here if you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And exiting to the main menu will save that checkpoint to your save file.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility &amp; Full Controller Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for controllers, with fully customisable buttons. Including accessibility options like rapid fire or toggle modes for various functions.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microvania is a tiny metroidvania</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So tiny, that the screen resolution is only 160x90!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Explore the depths of planet Micronus</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traverse and backtrack through meticulously crafted pixels of caves, jungles, labs, ruins, and more. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Find and make use of classic upgrade tropes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Missiles, Claw, Ball-Mode and more!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customise your play style</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Equip Microcards to modify your weapons and abilities.  Create your own play style.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Microvania respects your time</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don\u2019t worry about saving your progress - the game will create a checkpoint every time you enter a room, and you will spawn back here if you die.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And exiting to the main menu will save that checkpoint to your save file.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Accessibility &amp; Full Controller Support</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Designed for controllers, with fully customisable buttons. Including accessibility options like rapid fire or toggle modes for various functions.</p>",
    "short_description": "Explore a tiny world, find upgrades, discover hidden paths, and battle bosses in this retro-style metroidvania action platformer.",
